Subject: [PATCH] filament_scene: omit typed lighting payloads during startup probe

Use native default lighting while isolating the remaining scene startup type
contract. Shapes remain enabled for the render-path probe.
---
 packages/filament_scene/example/lib/main.dart | 2 -
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/filament_scene/example/lib/main.dart b/packages/filament_scene/example/lib/main.dart
--- a/packages/filament_scene/example/lib/main.dart
+++ b/packages/filament_scene/example/lib/main.dart
@@ -272,2 +272,0 @@
-      indirectLight: poGetDefaultIndirectLight(),
-      lights: poGetSceneLightsList(),

